commit 7843f5768904b8c7769d4ada982661f1bb222ba9

C03: the near-miss application clarification no longer trips the explicit-clarification assert (APPS1497)

APPS1495 measured that the near-application branch read its candidates and built the clarify result, but the result block then asserted an explicit clarification (only the deictic-referent and unresolved-input paths were exempt), so every case failed twice at runtime and the App recovered with a generic question that never named the candidate. The block now exempts the near-application path and labels it `near_application_clarification` in the turn audit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


diff --git a/src/baxy_mind/__main__.py b/src/baxy_mind/__main__.py
index ca1bba57..72947511 100644
